166: Lemma original_clamp_prefix_binding :
167:  match fn_body Source.f_guidance_pid_h_run_pos with
168:  | Ssequence _ (Ssequence a (Ssequence _ (Ssequence b _))) =>
169:    a=Ssequence(original_position_clamp Source._x)(original_position_clamp Source._y) /\
170:    b=Ssequence(original_speed_clamp Source._x)(original_speed_clamp Source._y)
171:  | _=>False end.
172: Proof. split;reflexivity. Qed.

